<title>POLAND: Stalexport 1996 group results. [CORRECTED 21:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>Stalexport 1996 group results. [CORRECTED 21:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport SA consolidated</p>
<p>results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit	     40.34  vs    41.77</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit		 52.87  vs    89.73</p>
<p>    group net profit		     26.06  vs    57.04</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales		   1,862.14  vs 1,868.61</p>
<p>    group costs of sales	    1,701.64  vs 1,684.31</p>
<p>    group extraordinary profit	  0.50  vs     0.78 loss</p>
<p>    group income tax		     20.70  vs    32.00</p>
<p>    group other taxes		     0.20  vs     0.28</p>
<p>    group financial revenues	   75.32  vs    85.03</p>
<p>    group financial costs		78.97  vs    53.35</p>
<p>(Corrects the years at the top of the table to 1996 and 1995 from 1997 and 1996 respectively.)</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
